{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QtE7KGKBNNyh5ov0Munagg?scene=1&click_id=45","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:58.092528+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QtE7KGKBNNyh5ov0Munagg?scene=1&click_id=45","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/VzZ0CcXrhrdPReZZdiaia5GwzGcYmp7jTicUosRx5pq0aSHZY8MXb9Pc9XxGSX1sibZBWRIQ7XRwdMLL4jEqW0yiakg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haVIB7oO3olDicQay3fmSNE3RiaY7JpVe4jaoaCaXtvCueiaGuChVKypmGqd2CASx3wUNu0ib0seuMXZRWCJXofFwribBib6TRwOzZPTQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为拓宽学生了解脑科学前沿知识的渠道，</span><span>北京协和医学院脑和类脑学院</span><span>（以下简称“北京脑所”）通过整合顶尖科研资源，开展以理论学习、科研体验、升学指导规划为核心的卓越人才夏令营活动，为有志深造的青年学子搭建高水平学术交流平台，助力学生提升核心学术能力，塑造严谨科研思维，充分激发个人科研兴趣与创新潜能，精准筛选适配本所培养的高素质创新型后备人才。</span></p><p><span>欢迎神经科学、生物科学、基础医学、心理学、认知科学、生物医学工程、计算机、人工智能等相关交叉专业，及有意向投身脑科学领域的在校学生积极报名，北京脑所将根据学生背景和报名情况，择优录取学生入营。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haVtpOMRZC9CqSWlVNWsxmKEzpuGoEoKLdI4vaalP6dAxVBXKia9tEDt1GOZW6Tp53EiaZ9khIpXoWaAbFgpbDpRrKacnNhBDNCYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京脑所成立于2018年3月22日，是北京市政府与中国科学院、北京大学、清华大学、北京师范大学、中国医学科学院、中国中医科学院等单位共建的新型研发机构。</span></p><p><span>宗旨是瞄准世界脑科学前沿和国家在脑科学研究领域的战略急需，通过创新体制机制，整合脑科学领域优势资源，搭建脑科学研究综合性实验和研发平台，汇聚全球顶尖人才和优秀科研团队，开展科技攻关，在脑科学领域产出一批重大原始创新成果，推进国际交流合作，建设成为面向科技前沿的世界一流脑科学研究研发机构。</span></p><p><span>北京脑所重点聚焦脑认知原理解析、脑重大疾病、神经科学新技术、神经工程等四大研究方向。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haX4EbQyWfVcibJSHrjUwtHflXPvuyxmXgtHfAiauiaDIOx30Jl1vzXLNQgkbjcnZtmWJ0ice7ZhqI4BYGPBWtUHUbmAGBaJ8lJANeM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>2026年7月5日 - 7月9日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>（7月5日下午报到，7月9日下午离营）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动地点</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>北京脑科学与类脑研究所</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线下集中式参观授课，包括：交叉学科研讨、前沿学术讲座、PI导师座谈、实验室参访、个人能力展示、升学规划指导等</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haWfPqesfprSPFZAFq83cYic1AKQ0nakXpia4PwGicLazwXj23gEbiar1s3ZPafibDwDpibvgZK5NeDx55dgW78nbTSvZJfX3lL8ZjWjU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>1. </span></strong></span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，个人品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span>全国高校全日制优秀本科三年级在校生（五年制专业需为本科四年级），身心健康，学习成绩优异；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span> 学术研究兴趣浓厚，英语水平良好，有较强的创新意识和专业能力；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4. </span></span></strong><span>诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span> 在脑科学、类脑智能等领域具备一定基础专业素养，热爱脑科学和类脑相关科研工作；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>6. </span></span></strong><span>可以全程参与卓越人才夏令营课程、实验参观、研讨汇报等各项活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haVSC269XYP87QIXiaFUWyjs4flK014Pk36rvB5Hx0Frsj1FzakbiaicODsd8ItzA8uIGZEWWmgA5ZXAl0OmfcCCFoOwqdHuON3NnE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 报名时间：</span></span></strong><span>截止日期</span><strong><span><span>6月14日</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span>进入信息收集问卷链接</span><strong><span><span>（https://wj.qq.com/s2/26492543/hu6p/）</span></span></strong><span>或</span><strong><span><span>扫描下方二维码</span></span></strong><span>，填写个人信息；</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haXF6vibjIl89CPicYArIjylUib45ibQBsAmYkXIibSSoNbribOpt4aoWcwSterj9eetf7qsWiarSdK1P5oQthPouDyalapg1JbEC61PKU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3. 提交报名材料包括：</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（1）</span></span></strong><span>报名申请表（</span><strong><span><span>文末阅读原文</span></span></strong><span>下载模板后填写打印，本人手写签名后提交）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2）</span></span></strong><span>有效身份证件扫描件（身份证件正反面均需扫描）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（3）</span></span></strong><span>学生证扫描件（学生证封面、个人信息页和学期注册页）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（4）</span></span></strong><span>本人自述（中英文双语，包括研究兴趣、科研经历、未来研究计划等）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（5）</span></span></strong><span>学业成绩单（前五/前七学期各科成绩，须加盖所在学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（6）</span></span></strong><span>总成绩排名证明（须加盖所在学校教务部门或所在院系公章）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（7）</span></span></strong><span>专家推荐信2封（</span><strong><span><span>文末阅读原文</span></span></strong><span>下载模板后填写打印，需要与报考专业相关的教授或相当专业技术职称的专家推荐，并请推荐专家通过工作单位公示的邮箱向</span><strong><span><span>cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn</span></span></strong><span>发送签字版扫描件）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（8）</span></span></strong><span>外语水平证明（英语四/六级成绩单、TOEFL成绩、GRE/GMAT成绩单扫描件等）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（9）</span></span></strong><span>其他可证明个人科研水平和能力的材料（获奖证书、学术论文、专利等，</span><strong><span><span>使用PDF文件格式</span></span></strong><span>）。</span></p><p><strong><span>所有材料按顺序整合成一个PDF文件提交，邮件和附件题目以“2026卓越人才夏令营-学生姓名-就读院校”命名，发送至北京脑所指定邮箱cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4. </span></span></strong><span>入选资格由评审委员会进行评审，择优录取，报名人须自觉保证提供材料的真实性，组委会将对材料进行复核，若发现不实情况，立即取消入选资格。入营结果将直接通知本人（以电子邮件或短信形式），届时未接到相关通知的报名人皆为未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haUW4OdUb6qsg2kX7LkibbHs7cibot4PHXiaZSltveWB4uNvTM4FO380hl7zrKJ6rYypoU2bvDerCX142SGJGM2xmJFcicTr4NvWtw4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong><span>卓越人才夏令营不向营员收取任何培训费用，北京脑所统一安排营员在生命科学园区住宿、研究所内部食堂就餐；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span>活动全程配备带队志愿者与课程助教，实验室参访期间由工作人员监护，卓越人才夏令营期间为营员购买人身意外险，发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由保险公司及营员本人承担；</span></p><p><strong><span><span></span></span></strong><span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haWdiarFzQh0T6JI6B7tcHPPUAUDSrFzmRSeDDs10Se8RuOGjI6IRT1nicKKiby4hFu4OZInuEuwmo2r0pH0b3nh3VczGRicbUAlJWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电话号码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>010-81912671</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>通讯地址</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>北京市昌平区中关村生命科学园医科路9号院3号楼北京脑所B座123办公室</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haUr8EmLe4AR94LSqgUQCjxQd8xrjyebFQziabmRES9a3J5slHZ3ZO5rgrlJiatyV69omV9tGObtv7E2AFJ8l4q9FQIAkiaP82qPU8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/VzZ0CcXrhrdPReZZdiaia5GwzGcYmp7jTicwDtLhus8AZMaWgr4jg7Egk41VwR9satFZoia8B3icnhl7RaD8PdOQZuQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ccefa08b76c4eb907e94ac781a2d08941e08113f2b13d712242abbc33ee9a65d","textLength":1787,"sourceSha256":"ca600960390a4573c76ae13ac0f4558ebb152138b105c7f76b8cf4f22f329b48","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2107c16b62a144471428","title":"2026年北京协和医学院脑和类脑学院2026年夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:58.092528+00:00"}
